      "text": "I came for the mystery of the Bermuda Triangle, but stayed for the incredible story of the people who call these islands home. It's amazing how a place with so few natural resources has built such a thriving community. This is exactly the kind of travel documentary I love—beautiful, thought-provoking, and full of surprises. Great work!",
